id: pm-review-sync-identity
title: Restore unique import identity for shared delivery PRs
description: "Reconcile duplicate PR 46 importer identities without losing either delivered item, historic evidence or append-only history. Validate the complete corpus and an isolated gated import and repeat."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
